":"","detail":"photos/0045.json","filename":"16316420700_58c5a5aeca_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/16316420700/","height":1925,"id":"16316420700","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/16316420700/16316420700_58c5a5aeca_o.jpg","sha256":"0b439de23cf5533d2e8ffaca7c4e5367a43d716cf5e8941b617a0b13c0b844b4","tags":[],"taken":"2014-10-27 08:03:04","title":"IMG_3670","uploaded":"2015-02-11 11:48:28","width":2939},"16316834331":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":2600},{"id":"72157646928615774","position":348}],"bytes":6843203,"camera_position":2600,"comments":[{"author":"50167308@N06","date":"2015-01-20 08:16:58","text":"I always pay special attention to downhill trucks, in particular to those logging trucks. \n\nE.g. has the driver shifted down gears early enough, are the logs safely in place, etc. \u2026\n\nEn-route with the bicycle one feels in direct interaction with everything around and therefore more vulnerable. I do not want to start safety discussions - it's just related to respect and sharpen your instinct ...\n:-)"},{"author":"100330886@N04","date":"2015-01-21 12:54:13","text":"We definitely came up with some routines for logging trucks.  They seem to have their own rules of the road and so we just took responsibility for the situations.  Mostly we watched our mirrors a lot, listened to the road and shouted to each other in more constricted places."}],"description":"","detail":"photos/0045.json","filename":"16316834331_5f5f3ce082_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/16316834331/","height":2284,"id":"16316834331","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/16316834331/16316834331_5f5f3ce082_o.jpg","sha256":"25fdc1eb26fd5a0e5bf89e255e3192ef0321ca0d87ec82092ecf5814908075b9","tags":[],"taken":"2014-10-10 15:47:28","title":"IMG_2330","uploaded":"2015-01-19 08:32:43","width":2699},"16317323291":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":2615},{"id":"72157646928615774","position":363}],"bytes":13856259,"camera_position":2615,"comments":[{"author":"50167308@N06","date":"2016-04-07 08:43:05","text":"Birth of the famous gitar box ..."},{"author":"100330886@N04","date":"2016-04-09 23:56:53","text":"Yup! :)"}],"description":"","detail":"photos/0045.json","filename":"16317323291_948f9923c7_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/16317323291/","height":4000,"id":"16317323291","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/16317323291/16317323291_948f9923c7_o.jpg","sha256":"c4154d8d8bc13d635a847775ac7fbbe82c9a1f0fba478de1e27fb151e23fc41f","tags":[],"taken":"2014-10-11 13:06:10","title":"IMG_2436","uploaded":"2015-01-19 09:46:01","width":3000},"16317454181":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":2611},{"id":"72157646928615774","position":359}],"bytes":5426860,"camera_position":2611,"comments":[],"description":"","detail":"photos/0045.json","filename":"16317454181_97f07c742f_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/16317454181/","height":3310,"id":"16317454181","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/16317454181/16317454181_97f07c742f_o.jpg","sha256":"0ad6f71b25a8fd1c17b20604cce98d60151e2d3899641efc072649d0e1d5374f","tags":[],"taken":"2014-10-11 09:45:57","title":"IMG_2422","uploaded":"2015-01-19 10:05:33","width":2014},"16317834962":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":2597},{"id":"72157646928615774","position":345}],"bytes":13488721,"camera_position":2597,"comments":[],"description":"","detail":"photos/0045.json","filename":"16317834962_b02657864d_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/16317834962/","height":2514,"id":"16317834962","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/16317834962/16317834962_b02657864d_o.jpg","sha256":"7ab5f2e3e840379e249e1ca01e9374c69b0b18b12aa319b098d047e1f6155e59","tags":[],"taken":"2014-10-10 12:58:13","tit